<title>JAPAN: Tada Corp falls on financial worries.</title>
<headline>Tada Corp falls on financial worries.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tada Corp shares slipped in Wednesday morning trade as investors, concerned about construction firms with possible financial worries, sold the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0128 GMT, Tada was down 13 yen or 6.95 percent at 174, the third largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
